Package: agentdagwood
Type: Package
Title: Shiny Causal Assumption Analyzer Using Dagwood and LLMs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Steven", family = "Baldasty", email = "sbaldasty@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts free-form causal inference scenarios into directed acyclic
    graphs using a language model, runs Dagwood to extract assumptions, and
    evaluates each assumption with model-based reasoning in a single Shiny app.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3)
Imports:
    shiny,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    dagwood,
    ggdag,
    later
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
